OL,3,AThe superstar tech boss - who is Jensen
OL,4,AHuang?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang, known for sporting a
OL,7,Fblack leather jacket to shareholder
OL,8,Fevents, appeared to have it all. He was
OL,9,Fcourted by leaders in both Washington
OL,10,Fand Beijing, worshipped by investors
OL,11,Fand seen as a loyal family man. But a
OL,12,Frockstar approach to his personal life
OL,13,Fhas ultimately led to his resignation.
OL,15,FThe 63-year-old has been married since
OL,16,F1985, long before the foundation of
OL,17,FNvidia, the company that propelled him
OL,18,Fto tech stardom, and he presented
OL,19,Fhimself as a loyal family man.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794500319
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe superstar tech boss - who is Jensen
OL,4,AHuang?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is known as a workaholic and a
OL,7,Fdemanding manager, with high standards
OL,8,Ffor those who worked for him, which
OL,9,Fincluded his own children, promoted
OL,10,Fwithin the company. But he has seen his
OL,11,Fpersonal reputation go into free fall
OL,12,Fthis week, undone by romantic
OL,13,Fentanglements, that throw doubt on his
OL,14,Ffocus and his judgement.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
