OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794500319
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe superstar tech boss - who is Jensen
OL,4,AHuang?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday he resigned following
OL,7,Fback-to-back revelations of two
OL,8,Faffairs. News of the first - a
OL,9,Frelationship with a businesswoman,
OL,10,Falleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,11,Fricocheted around the world, raising
OL,12,Feyebrows among investors. It was
OL,13,Ffollowed on Wednesday by reports that
OL,14,Fthe tech boss had also had an affair
OL,15,Fwith an Nvidia colleague.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
