OL,3,AWhat we know as Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aresigns over affair allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the AI industry's most important
OL,7,Ffigures has resigned amid allegations
OL,8,Fthat he had extramarital affairs with
OL,9,Ftwo women - one a suspected Chinese spy
OL,10,Fand the other a company executive.
OL,12,FChip-maker Nvidia hired a major law
OL,13,Ffirm earlier this week to investigate
OL,14,FCEO Jensen Huang's reported
OL,15,Frelationship with a woman who was
OL,16,Fallegedly a Chinese intelligence asset.
OL,18,FNow he has resigned after its stocks
OL,19,Fplummeted on Wednesday following US
OL,20,Fmedia reports about a second alleged
OL,21,Faffair.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
