OL,3,AWho is Nvidia's interim CEO Colette
OL,4,AKress - and who could take over
OL,5,Apermanently?
OL,6,
OL,7,FChief financial officer Colette Kress
OL,8,Fis in charge, for now, as the tech
OL,9,Fgiant faces one of its biggest
OL,10,Fchallenges - finding the right person
OL,11,Fto permanently lead the business that
OL,12,FHuang helped create more than three
OL,13,Fdecades ago and turned into one of the
OL,14,Fworld's most valuable companies.
OL,16,FWe take a look at which candidates have
OL,17,Femerged as potential successors.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/19
